<title>UK: BOE allots 1.05 bln stg in outright bills, repo.</title>
<headline>BOE allots 1.05 bln stg in outright bills, repo.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of England said that it provided the UK money market with 1.05 billion stg of assistance to help offset a forecast money market shortage of 1.35 billion.</p>
<p>It allotted 151 million stg in bills outright and 899 million stg in repos to April 21. The Bank's repo rate was unchanged at 6.0 percent.</p>
</text>
